  "summary": {
    "title": "",
    "columns": 1,
    "hidden": false,
    "content": "<p>Java backend developer. I build and run production systems end to end: REST APIs, databases, integrations, deployment and monitoring.</p><p>Most recently I owned the in-house ERP at Tekman Metal, a 20+ module system used daily by 30–35 people. I cut report generation from 3 minutes to seconds, integrated Turkish e-invoicing for 200+ invoices a day, and brought the codebase under Git, automated tests and Grafana monitoring.</p><p>As a freelancer I built an e-commerce backend as two Spring Boot services, with a reusable Iyzico payment service driven by webhooks. In EPAM's Java Developer program I built a microservice platform with Eureka, asynchronous ActiveMQ (JMS) messaging, JWT security, Prometheus metrics and 93 automated tests.</p><p>Before software I spent three years in ad tech (Taboola, Publicis Groupe), so I work from data and keep business goals in view.</p>"
  },
