    "experience": {
      "title": "",
      "columns": 1,
      "hidden": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "272143c6-e82e-4257-b3f6-1f80eda2c679",
          "hidden": false,
          "options": {
            "showLinkInTitle": false
          },
          "company": "Tekman Metal",
          "position": "ERP Software Developer",
          "location": "Amasya, Türkiye",
          "period": "05/2026 – 10/2026",
          "website": {
            "url": "",
            "label": ""
          },
          "description": "<p>Owned the in-house ERP of a metal manufacturer: 20+ modules and ~20,000 pages, used daily by 30–35 people in production, sales and accounting.</p><ul><li><p>Cut report generation from 3 minutes to seconds by redesigning schemas, indexes and views, tuning SQL, and fixing the ColdFusion template cache (trusted cache on, cache raised from 100 to 20,000 pages).</p></li><li><p>Integrated Turkish e-invoicing through Digital Planet (Sovos) over SOAP with UBL-TR and XSLT templates, handling 200+ incoming and outgoing e-invoices a day.</p></li><li><p>Built a production module linking shop-floor records with sales orders and accounting.</p></li><li><p>Put the production code under Git, set up an isolated test environment, and added JUnit and Mockito tests.</p></li><li><p>Set up Grafana monitoring and UUID-referenced error logging, so every user-reported error traces back to its request.</p></li></ul>"
        },
        {
          "id": "12f79522-27e9-42a9-a13b-fef6a5d53e12",
          "hidden": false,
          "options": {
            "showLinkInTitle": false
          },
          "company": "Self-employed",
          "position": "Freelance Backend & Full-Stack Developer",
          "location": "Remote, Türkiye",
          "period": "01/2023 – 05/2026",
          "website": {
            "url": "",
            "label": ""
          },
          "description": "<p>Designed, built and deployed backends and web apps for clients, from requirements to production.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Ahşap Home (e-commerce):</strong> backend as two Spring Boot services (Java 25, Spring Boot 4, PostgreSQL), a core service and a reusable Iyzico payment service with 3D Secure and webhooks; 41 REST endpoints serving 150–200 users a month.</p></li><li><p><strong>Ahşap Home:</strong> Spring Security with JWT and Google sign-in, Redis product caching, automated order e-mails, 13 Cucumber BDD scenarios and GitHub Actions CI.</p></li><li><p><strong>Mayavox (B2B platform):</strong> Spring Boot backend and React frontend with authentication, an admin notification panel and a client offer module that handled 50–75 offers.</p></li><li><p><strong>Influencer Homie:</strong> Java scraper (Spring Boot, Selenium, Jsoup) collecting 200+ Amazon affiliate coupons a day, replacing hours of manual work; React frontend with Cypress tests.</p></li><li><p>Docker images deployed to Linux servers through GitHub Actions and GitLab CI, behind Nginx and Cloudflare.</p></li></ul>"
        },
        {
          "id": "687ef3f3-acd9-428e-8f81-260e8f077227",
          "hidden": false,
          "options": {
            "showLinkInTitle": false
          },
          "company": "EPAM Systems",
          "position": "Java Developer Trainee",
          "location": "Remote",
          "period": "08/2025 – 04/2026",
          "website": {
            "url": "",
            "label": ""
          },
          "description": "<p>Java Developer training program run in Agile (Scrum) sprints with Jira, pull requests and code reviews.</p><ul><li><p>Built a Spring Boot microservice platform with Eureka, ActiveMQ (JMS) messaging, JWT security and Prometheus metrics: 20 REST endpoints, 93 unit tests and 24 Cucumber scenarios.</p></li><li><p>Built AWS Lambda functions in Java on DynamoDB in a team project with GitLab merge requests.</p></li><li><p>Wrote JUnit and Mockito tests with JaCoCo coverage and Checkstyle checks.</p></li></ul>"
        },
        {
          "id": "c5fdb8ce-c70a-46f3-af2c-6a477fc32dfd",
          "hidden": false,
          "options": {
